# an unnamed style in order, its articulation left to a slider: drive takes the slider (decision 076, #572)
&bar meter("4/4") step=120bpm
&style style=&(map=style sync=.5 harm=.75 drive=free(.35, 0..1) bright=.25)
&line step=2n 0 4
&keysV s=tri loop=C3 lpf=400..2400 * &style[drive]
&out map=sample [&line * &keysV]
